// Java run configuration support is optional: EnvProgramPatcher is registered
// from envswitcher-java.xml and loaded only in IDEs bundling the Java plugin.
// In every other IDE the verifier sees the class but cannot resolve its Java
// supertypes. The class is never loaded there, so these are expected.
// Everything else stays strict - do not widen these patterns.
io.github.mnaami.environmentswitcher:@PLUGIN_VERSION@:Access to unresolved class com.intellij.execution.runners.JavaProgramPatcher
